# Copy to .env.local in the project root. Never commit a real API key.
# Use 1 for an entirely offline model layer; no key needed.
DEMO_MODE=1

# For live Gemini: change DEMO_MODE to 0 and supply your own key.
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional model override. The default is defined only in src/lib/gemini/client.ts.
# GEMINI_MODEL=

# DATABASE_URL is not needed by Viva. The sandbox may supply one for its health check.
